---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const updated = 'July 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy · Warren Labs"
  description="How Warren Labs and the Attune macOS app handle your data. Short version: the app collects nothing, and this website only stores an email if you choose to give us one."
>
  <Nav variant="home" />
  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span>
      <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p class="sec-lede">
        Short version: the Attune app collects nothing at all, and this website only stores an
        email address if you choose to give us one.
      </p>

      <h3>Attune (the macOS app)</h3>
      <p>
        <strong>Attune collects, stores, transmits, and shares no personal data.</strong> It runs
        entirely on your Mac, has no network access, and contains no analytics, telemetry, or
        tracking of any kind. Audio files you choose are read locally only to play them — nothing
        about your music library, your listening, or your tunings ever leaves your device.
      </p>

      <h3>This website (warrenlabs.com)</h3>
      <p>
        If you enter your email address in a signup or waitlist form, we use it only to contact you
        about Warren Labs and Attune. It is stored by our form provider (Formspree) and by us, and
        is never sold or shared with advertisers. Ask us to delete it at any time. The site sets no
        advertising or cross-site tracking cookies.
      </p>

      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <p>
        Questions, or a deletion request: <a href="mailto:jamey@warrenlabs.com">jamey@warrenlabs.com</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer variant="home" />
</Layout>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 720px; }
  .prose h3 { margin: 30px 0 8px; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .prose p { margin: 0 0 14px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .prose .updated { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.55; }
</style>
